              "end": 25,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Scalia, the oral argument featured Justice Scalia questioning the government\u2019s conduct and the significance of the Export Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "81dc6d9f86dcaba9dd9b669ce69dc6048835d86b735a1608a59af4bd70417d9a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-81dc6d9f86dc-0000-0003",
              "ev-81dc6d9f86dc-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg raised questions about whether the suit should contest the constitutionality of the tax versus pursuing the administrative refund route."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts; Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "81dc6d9f86dcaba9dd9b669ce69dc6048835d86b735a1608a59af4bd70417d9a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-81dc6d9f86dc-0001-0005",
              "ev-81dc6d9f86dc-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts and Justice Kennedy inquired about the interest that would be due under the tax\u2011refund scheme."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Oral Argument",
